<title>USA: Marcus plans 12-screen theater in Kenosha.</title>
<headline>Marcus plans 12-screen theater in Kenosha.</headline>
<dateline>KENOSHA, Wis. 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Marcus Theatres Corp, a division of Milwaukee-based Marcus Corp, said Tuesday it plans to build a 12-screen theater in Kenosha, Wis.</p>
<p>The site will accommodate future expansion to 20 screens, it said.</p>
<p>A mid-1997 opening date is projected.</p>
<p>Marcus currently operates 286 screens in Wisconsin and Illinois and a family entertainment center in Wisconsin.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
